# Read by BuildKit for scripts/demo/x402-seller.Dockerfile, with the repository root as the context.
# An allowlist: nothing enters the image unless it is named here, so no key, `.env` or local state can.
*

# The workspace's manifests: `bun install --frozen-lockfile` resolves every workspace from the lockfile.
!package.json
!bun.lock
!apps/*/package.json
!contracts/package.json
!packages/*/package.json

# What the seller runs: one file, which imports only @x402/* and viem.
!scripts/demo/x402-fake-seller.ts

# Dropped again inside what was allowed.
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.jsonl
**/.arp
